  triage:deferredNote "Fix: rewrite CLAUDE.md's 'Phase Integration Branch Strategy' section to describe the append-only-stack model (feedback_append_only_stack, feedback_stack_all_phase_sprints, feedback_ci_only_on_top_layer conventions), replacing the serial per-sprint merge-latest-before-PR description. Suggested owner: arch-ctm (per QA report's next_action); routing pending fenix's dispatch ruling." ;
